<title>USA: Reliance Acceptance board suspends qtly div.</title>
<headline>Reliance Acceptance board suspends qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliance Acceptance Group Inc said Wednesday that its board had elected to suspend payment of its quarterly dividend.</p>
<p>&quot;The directors will review the appropriateness of resuming the dividend for future quarters on an ongoing basis,&quot; the company said in a statement issued Wednesay evening.</p>
<p>The company provided no further details, nor did it state a reason for the move.</p>
</text>
